For migration: 
--------------
Copy the migration scripts to the folder migrations

After migration:
----------------
1. After the sucessful run of the current bacth of migration scripts,
it will be moved to the archival folder of scripts for reference.

2. The collection migrationsLog will also be copied and emptied.

Note: 
This will make the system ready for next set of migration scripts


Disable in mongoose connection
------------------------------
mongoose.connect(uri, {
 autoIndex: false,
 autoCreate: false
})

