Updated Migration Philosophy
----------------------------
Collections
collection not exists
    → create

collection exists
    → compare validator + options
        mismatch → apply collMod
Indexes
index not exists
    → create

index exists
    → compare keys + options
        mismatch → drop and recreate

        Why drop and recreate for indexes?

Because in MongoDB most index properties cannot be modified in-place.


Behavior of the System Now
--------------------------------------------------------
Situation	Result
--------------------------------------------------------
Collection missing	                    created
Collection validator different	        collMod
Index missing	                        created
Index definition changed	            dropped + recreated
--------------------------------------------------------

